From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:10:47 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 378/443] [ae-patch] Fix the review findings on the voice log
 upload (0377)

A chat switch no longer counts as Voice ending, and the voice_end upload goes to the chat Voice came on in. An upload carries only the last two minutes and is trimmed by bytes, not characters. Automatic reasons share one budget of one upload per 60 s, spent only after the server accepts; a manual send skips it. The menu says "Voice log sent" only when it was sent. A mic stopped from outside is no longer uploaded in a chat (the user's own stop looks the same). The new-chat Voice button shows its hint icon again for touch users.
